   "id": "a2736b41-8e07-69d4-2192-ce7f54e14df8",
   "text": {
    "html": "<h6 class=\"heading-xsmall\"><strong data-w-id=\"c9aed6f9-1056-8797-42b6-8092ae5f84cb\">Our Premium Matcha</strong> is crafted in Japan from the finest organic green tea leaves, delivering exceptional quality for lattes and specialty drinks. <br data-w-id=\"bb8ebf62-71ad-4c6f-7fdb-02d255cf367a\"><br data-w-id=\"7ae68a4a-0fba-c6c4-ee7f-97236a494479\">Smooth, naturally sweet, and vividly green, it’s a top choice for cafés and creators of matcha‑based beverages. <br data-w-id=\"92a00af5-391e-215c-42a4-ef6594a75fbc\"><br data-w-id=\"2d34e450-44ed-2d55-9e56-fdd70cb02373\">A true premium option for wholesalers and businesses seeking bulk matcha with consistent, authentic Japanese quality.<br data-w-id=\"8e6f89d1-ab2b-6254-8d47-2fa09817ddee\"><br data-w-id=\"bbe3139d-fd08-a557-3bc4-2e2dc468dd76\">Available through our <a data-wf-link-page-id=\"698ed39e8999d2a9cf8e7e17\" data-w-id=\"ec24719a-e8b4-2eda-1d1a-fa81eac02076\">wholesale bulk supply programs</a>.</h6>",
    "text": "Our Premium Matcha is crafted in Japan from the finest organic green tea leaves, delivering exceptional quality for lattes and specialty drinks. \n\nSmooth, naturally sweet, and vividly green, it’s a top choice for cafés and creators of matcha‑based beverages. \n\nA true premium option for wholesalers and businesses seeking bulk matcha with consistent, authentic Japanese quality.\n\nAvailable through our wholesale bulk supply programs."
   },
